OL,3,GNEWSAGroup sentenced for kidnapping
OL,4,Ahomeless man
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been sentenced after
OL,7,Fkidnapping a homeless man whose screams
OL,8,Fwere captured on doorbell camera
OL,9,Ffootage.
OL,11,FChesterfield Magistrates' Court heard
OL,12,Fthe victim was chased, assaulted and
OL,13,Fbundled into the boot of a car in
OL,14,FBridge Street, Ilkeston, Derbyshire, on
OL,15,F30 July. He was found bleeding in the
OL,16,Fvehicle by officers in a Tesco car
OL,17,Fpark.
OL,19,FThe victim suffered injuries to his
OL,20,Farms, knees and legs, and suffered a
OL,21,Fbruised head. No motive was given.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
