OL,3,GNEWSAGroup sentenced for kidnapping
OL,4,Ahomeless man
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewis Birks-Iacovitti, 25, Kien Rigley,
OL,7,F23, and Kainan Wilson, 21, were given
OL,8,Fsuspended prison sentences, while Zabed
OL,9,FMiah, 24, was jailed for two years and
OL,10,F10 months on Tuesday. All four had
OL,11,Fpleaded guilty to one count of kidnap.
